s":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"Hybrid styling"},"1058":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-2","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#examples","content":"Examples"},"1059":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-3","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#default","content":"Default"},"1060":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-4","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#props","content":"Props"},"1061":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-5","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#content","content":"Content"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-6","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#header","content":"Header"},"1063":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-7","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#footer","content":"Footer"},"1064":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-8","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/structure#buttongroup","content":"ButtonGroup"},"1065":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-9","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."},"1066":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-10","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Content`** — the primary body region (a `<section>`, a column that grows to fill)."},"1067":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-11","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."},"1068":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-12","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`Footer`** — the bottom region: secondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."},"1069":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-13","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`ButtonGroup`** — a cluster of related actions, typically inside a `Footer` (an end-aligned, wrapping row with `role=\"group\"`)."},"1070":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-14","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"Each container works in two modes:"},"1071":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-15","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"**Standalone** — with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."},"1072":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-16","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"**Adopted** — placed inside a parent that provides its context (`ContentContext`, `HeaderContext`, `FooterContext`, `ButtonGroupContext`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Merge precedence is defaults \\< parent context \\< consumer props (`className` concatenates, handlers chain), via React Aria's `useContextProps`."},"1073":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-17","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"A parent adopts them by providing the contexts around its children:"},"1074":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-18","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#default","content":"The shared structural containers composed together into a card-like layout. Each is a\nplain semantic region here; inside a parent that provides their contexts (e.g. `Modal`)\nthey adopt that parent's spacing automatically."},"1075":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-19","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#props","content":"`Content`, `Header`, `Footer`, and `ButtonGroup` each accept all `Flex` layout props."},"1076":{"id":"/docs/components/switch","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"page","content":"Switch","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch"},"1077":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-0","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/switch","content":"A binary toggle control that switches a setting between on and off states, communicated via the WAI-ARIA switch role."},"1078":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-1","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#features","content":"Features"},"1079":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-2","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#installation","content":"Installation"},"1080":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-3","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#examples","content":"Examples"},"1081":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-4","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#default","content":"Default"},"1082":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-5","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch