sabled`"],[205,"**CheckboxGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[518,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[457,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[588,"**Composes into other components**: `Select` uses `ListBox` internally; reach for `ListBox` directly when you need an inline list rather than a popover dropdown."],[364,"**Composition primitives.** The field components (TextField, NumberField, DateField, Select, RadioGroup, CheckboxGroup) compose these internally — reach for those first. These primitives are also the building blocks for custom composite fields, e.g. an input and a select sharing one bordered box."],[529,"**Consider preloading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[586,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[1043,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1229,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1350,"**Controls keep their own type.** A `Button` inside a lockup is sized by its own `size` prop,\nnot the lockup's."],[1632,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[1426,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[1425,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[1482,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[517,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1423,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[519,"**DOM Output:**"],[1295,"**End**"],[212,"**errorMessage**: Displays validation error text below the group"],[464,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[535,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[523,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[508,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[456,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1045,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[511,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1441,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1453,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1293,"**Home**"],[730,"**Home** / **End**: jump to `minValue` or `maxValue` when those props are set"],[1456,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1445,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[1631,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[1622,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[486,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[526,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[1424,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[211,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[210,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[1448,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[1041,"**Label, description, error**: Optional label, helper text, and error message with proper accessibility"],[1227,"**Label, description, error**: Optional label, helper text, and error message with proper accessibility"],[587,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1312,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[1481,"**Limit data points**: Consider pagination or filtering for very large datasets (>100 points)"],[522,"**Lower Memory Usage**: Especially beneficial with many repeated icons"],[1443,"**Margins**: 20px top/right, 60px bottom/left for axes and labels"],[539,"**Minimize icon sets**: Only load icons that are actually used"],[1447,"**Minimum spacing**: Group gaps never fall below 24px, triggering scroll instead"],[1230,"**Multiline**: Set `multiline` to render a textarea instead of a single-line input"],[533,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[844,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[454,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[729,"**Page Up** / **Page Down**: larger increase or decrease when supported"],[520,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[537,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[530,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[958,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[957,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly